1
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
[waves crashing]

2
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:07,500
Detective Hale: Mara, where were you
on the night of the storm?

3
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Mara: I was here. I never left the lighthouse.

4
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,500
Detective Hale: Then why is the lamp
logbook missing a page?

5
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Mara: <i>I don't know what you mean.</i>

6
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Detective Hale: Someone tore it out,
and your fingerprints are on the cover.

7
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,500
Mara: My father kept that book
for thirty years.

8
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,500
Detective Hale: Then you know what
he wrote on that last page.

9
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,500
Mara: I know.

10
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Mara: He wrote the name of the man
who wrecked the ship.

11
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,500
[music]